WEBVTT

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:37.290
﻿As a member of the Capital Guard, I wanted
﻿to learn more about the Amerian space fleet.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:41.420
﻿And for that, I was willing to
﻿lie and hang around with pirates.

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:44.300
﻿But when I heard my instructor's voice...

00:01:44.300 --> 00:01:45.720
﻿That wasn't just my imagination.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:49.640
﻿There's no doubt that I heard it.

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:24.300
﻿Allow me to tell you the truth about myself.

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:27.680
﻿In fact, I am one of the Kuntala.

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:33.850
﻿I've learned that all of you who
were chosen are Kuntala as well.

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:35.810
﻿What is a Kuntala?

00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:41.650
﻿﻿I hear that it referred to a class of inferior
people used as food in a past era.

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:44.780
﻿If we produce results as
﻿the Garanden's Mask Corps,

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.610
﻿the Kuntala's position
﻿in society will improve.

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:49.820
﻿And then, we could even
﻿rule Capital Tower!

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:51.620
﻿That's right!

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.790
﻿- The Mask Corps'...
- ﻿...Elf Bullock Team...

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:56.500
﻿...will crush the space pirates!

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:14.680
﻿If you go there, you'll be in the way!

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.390
﻿You can't! You can't!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.020
﻿What's up?

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:23.150
﻿- Lower the machine gun.
﻿- Right.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:27.150
﻿Keep on lowering it!

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:29.700
﻿Keep going! Good!

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:34.410
﻿Raraiya said she wanted to take a nap with
﻿the G-Self and wouldn't listen to me!

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:36.450
﻿Hey, boy!

00:03:36.450 --> 00:03:38.000
﻿Your job is done here.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.960
﻿Okay, I'll be leaving then.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:47.510
﻿That Raraiya girl...

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:50.760
﻿If she feels a sense of
﻿familiarity with the G-Self...

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.430
﻿Oh.

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:55.060
﻿Hey, it's inflating.

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:57.100
﻿Will it really look like the Megafauna?

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.800
- We're here.
- ﻿The first nut, Coriole.

00:04:30.130 --> 00:04:33.300
﻿- Shutting up the Amerians will be easy.
﻿- War time economies are quite simple.

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.100
﻿Ugh. My body weight keeps going up.

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:40.060
﻿I don't think that's the inertial gravity.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:45.020
﻿Thanks for your regular patronage.

00:04:45.020 --> 00:04:46.520
﻿Thank you, too.

00:04:49.980 --> 00:04:52.030
They're even letting things
like that into town!

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.500
﻿Why are Doubeys allowed to fly here?

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.710
﻿Jugan! He did this without clearance from me!

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.970
﻿Give them the largest hall?

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:18.300
﻿It's an order from the Capital Government.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.720
﻿Curse you, Jugan!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:44.870
﻿Thank you.

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.670
﻿Commander Jugan,

00:05:47.670 --> 00:05:50.710
﻿this is not a front line
﻿base for the Capital Army.

00:05:50.710 --> 00:05:54.840
﻿We're just transporting ration,
﻿water, and air balls, you know?

00:05:54.840 --> 00:05:57.680
﻿Commander, we've located
﻿the space pirate ship.

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:59.300
﻿Can you see the Megafauna?

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.930
﻿Pirate ship?

00:06:00.930 --> 00:06:02.270
﻿Yes, this is it.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.180
﻿It's blurry!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.770
﻿If we correct for atmospheric
﻿blurring any further...

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:10.860
<i>﻿Bell is there!</i>

00:06:10.860 --> 00:06:12.150
﻿What is it?

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:13.780
﻿E-Excuse me.

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:17.780
﻿As Operations Director, I've been wanting
﻿a look at that pirate ship myself.

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.620
﻿- Pardon me.
﻿- It's fine.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.290
﻿- Becker.
- ﻿Yes?

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:33.090
﻿I'd like a look at the Garanden that
﻿Colonel Cumpa procured for us.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.260
﻿I can't see a thing!

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:38.470
﻿This is it.

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:54.150
﻿A warship as a foothold for advance troops?

00:06:54.150 --> 00:06:56.690
﻿Commander Jugan is a clever one.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:05.370
﻿Is that the Megafauna's dummy balloon?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:16.130
﻿What business does a unit that reports
﻿directly to the Inspector General have here?

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:18.470
﻿We're here to resupply you, of course!

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:20.590
﻿With G-type parts, and such.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:33.860
﻿Okay, the G-Self's Space Backpack has arrived!

00:07:36.070 --> 00:07:39.070
﻿This Assault Pack hasn't
﻿even been test fired!

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:40.410
﻿Happa!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.120
﻿I figured that might be the case!

00:07:42.570 --> 00:07:45.450
﻿They want us to give it a real
﻿test in actual combat, I'm sure.

00:07:45.450 --> 00:07:46.700
﻿For goodness sakes... Woah!

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:50.250
﻿You're joking, right?

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:52.250
﻿Even if we've finished
﻿maintenance on the guns,

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:56.460
﻿our supplies from the
﻿mainland just arrived now!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:08:03.140
﻿They said to move up the schedule for
﻿getting the fleet into satellite orbit.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.680
﻿Still...

00:08:05.100 --> 00:08:09.020
﻿Under these circumstances, we have no
﻿choice but to do a decoy operation.

00:08:09.690 --> 00:08:13.980
﻿What are the Montero and G-Self doing on that?

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:19.280
﻿Lieutenant Klim is adjusting
﻿its connection to the Belay.

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:25.030
﻿I see. Do you think the dummy balloon
﻿we sent out will trick the Capital Army?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.910
﻿It'll put my mind at ease, at least.

00:08:27.580 --> 00:08:30.710
﻿After all, we can't rely on communications.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:32.620
That's why they have to send messengers.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:37.670
﻿Because of that, our cargo
﻿arrives by Belay and Ladle.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.340
﻿Look into these eyes you so love.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:44.800
﻿It will awaken you.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:47.560
﻿These eyes you love want to see it.

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:49.060
﻿Chuchumy does too.

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:53.690
﻿Pretty eyes...

00:08:54.190 --> 00:08:56.610
﻿Because it is you I see with them.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.690
﻿Chuchumy...

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:05.280
﻿Chuchumy and I both want to see it.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.700
﻿To see you pilot this machine.

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:09.160
﻿Pilot?

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:10.660
﻿Can I do it?

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:12.910
﻿Chuchumy...

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:15.880
﻿Yes, you can.

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.550
﻿- I can use this...
- ﻿Captain, the door was open!

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.680
﻿That's an atmospheric entry glider!

00:09:29.680 --> 00:09:31.520
﻿A glider, you say?

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.480
﻿We're prepared for everything
﻿at Capital Tower!

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:37.810
﻿Doesn't this violate the Ag-Tech taboo?

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:43.320
﻿It is of historical value. Such things
﻿must be maintained in working order.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:47.030
﻿This glider just goes down.
﻿Can it be of use to us?

00:09:47.030 --> 00:09:49.240
﻿We could put it to use for
﻿reconnaissance and such.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.200
﻿It's closing!

00:09:54.920 --> 00:09:57.210
﻿Captain, take shelter in the airlock!

00:09:58.170 --> 00:09:59.210
﻿How?!

00:09:59.210 --> 00:10:00.500
﻿It's opening!

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.960
﻿That old lady...

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:07.720
﻿Oh, no! It's opening! It's opening!

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.970
﻿Why? Why did it open?

00:10:14.640 --> 00:10:16.730
﻿It's from Captain Becker.

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.730
﻿It's me.

00:10:18.730 --> 00:10:21.570
﻿It launched with Director Wilmit aboard.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.780
﻿Radio contact is cut off now too.

00:10:23.780 --> 00:10:26.950
﻿Was the old hag doing an
﻿inspection or something?

00:10:27.410 --> 00:10:29.950
﻿Once that thing launches,
﻿it can't come back here.

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:34.870
﻿Oh, if she botches her entry angle,

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:37.290
﻿she'll burn up in the atmosphere.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:44.090
﻿I put on the best act I could.

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:45.380
﻿Huh?

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:49.300
﻿It's not here.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:53.640
﻿There's no space suit.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:58.100
﻿Am I falling, or flying?

00:11:06.820 --> 00:11:08.950
﻿I will have Raraiya do it.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:11.070
﻿You did it? Wonderful.

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:14.290
﻿Raraiya, I will head over to the Montero.

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:15.370
Oh.

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:19.460
﻿Could you have the G-Self carry a rifle
﻿and point it in front of the Belay?

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:24.500
﻿Chuchumy and I are watching you.

00:11:24.500 --> 00:11:26.670
﻿Chuchumy's watching?

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:39.270
﻿The enemy is on the other
﻿side of this island!

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:43.900
﻿The Elf Bullocks will perform a
﻿Beam Saber oscillation test.

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:56.830
﻿Unknown flying objects detected!

00:11:56.830 --> 00:11:59.040
﻿What?! Gisela!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:01.620
﻿Check their position relative
﻿to the dummy balloon.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:02.790
﻿Tell me when you've got it!

00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.630
﻿There's an alert!

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:08.880
﻿Good, Raraiya, my dear. Now can
﻿you try holding the shield?

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.550
﻿Shield?

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.060
﻿Shield...

00:12:18.060 --> 00:12:20.810
﻿It appears to be operating normally.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:26.060
﻿It's mine! It's mine!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.520
﻿Chuchumy, look.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:29.400
﻿It's mine.

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:31.110
﻿I'll head out as well!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.900
﻿- Where were you?!
﻿- I was eating.

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.200
﻿I ate!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:38.160
﻿Bell!

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:42.160
﻿What?! Hey! They say the
﻿G-Self's gone out too!

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.160
﻿Huh?!

00:12:43.170 --> 00:12:44.670
﻿What does that mean?

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:50.420
﻿Mid-air transformation!
﻿You're taking too long!

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:56.640
﻿So they're coming from the
﻿other side of the island?

00:13:02.560 --> 00:13:05.230
﻿You'll have to ask the higher-ups
﻿about that kind of thing.

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:06.940
﻿You're still doing that?

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:10.440
﻿Keeping oneself properly fed is
﻿an important duty for a pilot!

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:12.360
﻿Hurry it up.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:14.780
﻿I'll head out in the Arcane.

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:17.530
﻿Do we have a machine for
﻿Bellri Zenam to pilot?

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:21.120
﻿The Jahannam on the Ladle out
﻿on the deck should be usable!

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:22.620
﻿But are you sure we should let him?

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.290
﻿You've seen what he's capable of.

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:26.540
﻿Bell!

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.000
﻿- Coming!
- ﻿But...!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.340
﻿Run to the Jahannam on the deck!

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.460
﻿They're bullying you!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:35.630
﻿The Ladle's pilot is Ginger!

00:13:35.630 --> 00:13:36.930
﻿- Go!
- ﻿Right!

00:13:36.930 --> 00:13:38.050
﻿This is as far as you go!

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:40.810
- ﻿I'll go!
- We're counting on you!

00:13:43.430 --> 00:13:46.940
﻿The Jahannam is a standard
﻿Amerian Army Mobile Suit.

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.940
﻿Bellri Zenam, get aboard!

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:51.440
- Okay!
- Good to go!

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:00.910
﻿It's Universal System compliant.
﻿You ought to be able to use it.

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.490
﻿Protect the ship!

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:04.160
﻿Just leave it to me!

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:08.210
﻿It'll be another two or three
﻿years before I can say that.

00:14:08.210 --> 00:14:10.000
﻿Bellri, was it? We're heading out!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:20.800
- ﻿You've oriented yourself, right?
﻿- Yes.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.140
﻿Can you do this?

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:24.560
﻿Let me give the Beam Rifle a test fire.

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.270
﻿- Give it a shot!
﻿- Right.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.820
﻿Why didn't you shoot upwards?!

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:39.490
﻿Are you okay with the enemy seeing the beam?

00:14:39.490 --> 00:14:41.870
﻿Minovsky Particles have
﻿been spread, you know?

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.160
﻿Roger that.

00:14:51.710 --> 00:14:52.960
﻿Set angle.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:56.420
﻿I think I've managed to trick them like this.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:06.680
﻿I forgot to bring bananas and those
﻿cinnamon biscuits that Bellri likes!

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.310
﻿Will the heat shielding and sealing hold?

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:13.650
﻿SU-Cord.

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.820
﻿Is that true?

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:20.150
﻿Get your machine back in position.

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:24.990
﻿I heard Lieutenant Klim saying
﻿"Raraiya, my dear," in syrupy tones.

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:27.540
﻿Raraiya's in the pilot's seat?

00:15:27.540 --> 00:15:29.870
﻿I don't think she's even got
﻿her memories back yet.

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.500
﻿You can hear me over the contact link, right?

00:15:34.840 --> 00:15:37.340
﻿- Bellri Zenam.
﻿- Are you serious?

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:39.670
﻿Taking out a huge rifle like that.

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:42.220
﻿I won't let you tell me what to do.

00:15:42.220 --> 00:15:45.550
﻿The unknowns coming in from the west...

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.430
﻿Are they Capital Army?

00:15:48.850 --> 00:15:51.850
﻿The Capital Army doesn't
﻿have maritime forces.

00:15:52.690 --> 00:15:54.560
﻿Well, they're here now!

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:57.570
﻿Raraiya, dear!

00:15:58.280 --> 00:16:00.070
﻿Crouch down! You could fall!

00:16:00.070 --> 00:16:02.150
﻿A flash! There's flashing!

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:04.870
﻿A flash? Are they fighting the unknowns?

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:20.710
﻿Raraiya!

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.060
﻿Which of them went down?

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:36.940
﻿There was a flash! Chuchumy!

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:39.190
﻿Mr. Pretty Eyes!

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.280
﻿So you've come, G-Self!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:53.620
﻿Are you going to transform?

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.550
That unit which the Captain failed to capture

00:17:00.550 --> 00:17:03.760
﻿still hasn't been fully investigated
﻿by the Capital Army!

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.010
﻿I'll be seizing it!

00:17:06.510 --> 00:17:08.180
﻿Amerian Mobile Suits are no match!

00:17:12.230 --> 00:17:14.180
﻿Wh-What?!

00:17:17.940 --> 00:17:19.650
﻿What?!

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.860
﻿I-I'll drown!

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:28.530
﻿I'll sink! Chuchumy!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:35.580
﻿She can't do this at all!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:48.800
﻿Go limp!

00:17:52.270 --> 00:17:54.310
﻿I'll go save Klim's Montero.

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:55.270
﻿Roger that.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:09.950
﻿Rara.

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:15.830
﻿Bell! Bell!

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:18.540
﻿Rin! Rin! Rin! Rin!

00:18:18.550 --> 00:18:19.540
﻿Ah.

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:19.550
﻿Chuchumy wants to see outside, doesn't she?
﻿Ah.

00:18:19.550 --> 00:18:21.750
﻿Chuchumy wants to see outside, doesn't she?

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:23.590
﻿Outside?

00:18:23.590 --> 00:18:25.340
﻿She looks happy, doesn't she?

00:18:30.180 --> 00:18:32.140
﻿It has red eyes.

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:36.430
﻿Excuse me, could you take care of this girl?

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.600
﻿Sure, but what about you?

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.270
﻿I'll go save the Lieutenant and Miss Aida.

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.160
﻿If you would kindly be shot down!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:00.920
﻿I see you are unable to
fly in Mobile Suit form.

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:02.250
﻿Well, in that case...!

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.630
﻿I won't let a wounded foe escape!

00:19:09.550 --> 00:19:10.510
﻿! can't get away!

00:19:11.510 --> 00:19:13.010
﻿A new model's coming to help him?

00:19:14.010 --> 00:19:17.020
﻿The Capital Army has a
﻿whole organized fleet?

00:19:22.940 --> 00:19:25.770
﻿You people act like you're
﻿the Amerian Army's elites!

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:35.990
﻿Hmph! A bunch of elites aspiring
﻿to be pirates changes nothing!

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:40.660
﻿He's aiming at me!

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:46.300
﻿This is bad! Klim!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:50.850
﻿I...

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:54.720
﻿I'll be taking this—

00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:58.180
﻿I got cut!

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.730
﻿C-Captain Mask!

00:20:07.280 --> 00:20:10.070
﻿G-Self, you've emerged
﻿from the ocean, have you?

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.070
﻿The contact link's been
﻿established! Miss Aida!

00:20:14.070 --> 00:20:15.620
﻿Use the booster!

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:17.700
﻿Bellri Zenam? Like this?!

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.880
﻿- Miss Aida, we'll intercept them.
- R﻿ight.

00:20:37.390 --> 00:20:40.560
﻿The G-Self is nothing a pirate
﻿should be allowed to use!

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:47.820
﻿The G-Self fell from the sky! Do you people
﻿not understand what that means?!

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.360
﻿Go down!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.830
﻿Rayhunton?! I can control it!

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:04.960
﻿Won't he go down?

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:09.380
﻿A barrier?!

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:12.420
﻿Even with that, I just need one
﻿more push to capture it!

00:21:15.800 --> 00:21:17.300
﻿We need to help Bellri.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.140
﻿My lady, you are being reckless!

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:20.890
﻿The G-Self is not infallible!

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:23.850
﻿Let's all withdraw together!

00:21:24.350 --> 00:21:25.980
﻿You're wounded, aren't you?

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.690
﻿Then I'll shoot all of you down together!

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:31.860
﻿What?

00:21:34.990 --> 00:21:36.240
﻿What the—?!

00:21:40.370 --> 00:21:41.950
﻿Amerian Army reinforcements?

00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:49.210
﻿My lady, the Armorzagan is here!

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:53.170
﻿Father has even had things
﻿like that developed?

00:21:54.340 --> 00:21:55.420
﻿But...

00:21:55.930 --> 00:21:57.720
﻿It saved our lives.

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:02.760
﻿Is that an Amerian Mobile Armor?

00:22:04.480 --> 00:22:05.640
﻿Even so,

00:22:06.810 --> 00:22:08.940
﻿that unit wasn't fully destroyed.

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:17.280
﻿Bell must be somewhere on that island.

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:03.940
﻿Before we can talk about this threat from space,

00:24:03.940 --> 00:24:07.770
﻿we get tormented by attacks from
﻿a unit with transforming suits.

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:09.570
﻿In order to take them out,

00:24:09.570 --> 00:24:14.610
﻿Aida's father tells me to fight
﻿them with a pink backpack.

00:24:14.610 --> 00:24:16.780
﻿Mom, help me out here!

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:20.580
﻿On the next episode of Reconguista in G,

00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:22.950
﻿Mother, Father, and Mask.

00:24:22.960 --> 00:24:24.960
﻿Don't watch it while walking!
